# Accepted Trivy findings — each line needs a written reason.
# Only UNFIXED vulnerabilities are ignored by the CI step itself
# (ignore-unfixed); entries here must be fixable findings we consciously
# accept, with the reason and the date it was accepted.
#
# Format: CVE-ID  # reason (accepted YYYY-MM-DD)
#
# Example:
# CVE-2024-12345  # base-image CVE in zlib, fix pending upstream; low runtime exposure (accepted 2026-10-27)
